{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b107d23faa983ad344dbe3baab52f14588a27c0697575a5a385681543b73757d", "ja": "（今日は、宣材写真の撮影だ。麗花の魅力を\nバッチリ伝えられる写真を撮ってもらわないと……）", "zh": "（今天来拍摄宣传照。\n要帮丽花拍出能完美表现出她魅力的照片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "c2842c54e227da516160aff4b4f21f11426b4f86c4378142c709f35d5c08af84", "ja": "ご心配なく、プロデューサーさん。私の魅力が\nギュギュッとつまった写真を持ってきました！", "zh": "不用担心，制作人先生。\n我带了充满我魅力的照片过来啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "297d2ea1b77f5cb1e3f533a1208bc690b4ced186d41b5b4b075833f4fbddd54c", "ja": "これです、これこれ。見てください！", "zh": "就是这张，这张这张。请看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "be45a55b283c1afc0a5e1bfa2c1120279ba91722a01f24440e09b680c681247a", "ja": "どれどれ……ん？\n山の写真……？", "zh": "我看看……嗯？\n这是山的照片……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "fed3f525ae658efc769ea4cc5ad3345dfb8bf242799707e17ab922bec0a2f55d", "ja": "はい！　私、登山が好きなんです♪　なので\n山を背景にパシャッと撮ってきました！　えっへん♪", "zh": "没错！我很喜欢爬山♪\n所以就以山为背景喀嚓一声拍下来啰！厉害吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4e4dca0ff7fe956d8abdc65c0889982a26492db4d211b6a957fcebaf508e6a5e", "ja": "そうなのか。いい写真だとは思うけど、\n宣材写真にはちょっと向いてないかな……。", "zh": "原来是这样。这张照片是很棒没错，\n但应该不太适合当作宣传照吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "38f505b74102df2335bb0558bc9b055257b0a194c8e1adf896098caa0ce3ffc6", "ja": "そうなんですか、残念！\nどんな山で撮ればいいですか？　標高が高めとか？", "zh": "是这样吗？真可惜！\n不然要拍哪种山才行呢？海拔高一点的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fdc744c86310b879a51f4a3069d7812cf1e309905e6fa42db2059c13fbbd0388", "ja": "山じゃなくて麗花の魅力を伝える写真が欲しいんだ。\n今回はこのスタジオで撮らせてほしい。", "zh": "我们要的不是山，而是要表现出丽花魅力的照片。\n所以希望你在这间摄影棚里面拍照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "34f7efa2503098b2ff0742b9e96970aa077b1b9baf7dab79d7516ae076f4dc3d", "ja": "でも、そうだな……大好きな山を登っているような\n気持ちで、撮影に挑戦してみてほしいかな！", "zh": "不过，不如这样吧……你想像爬最喜欢的山时的心情，\n挑战看看这次拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "aeb4d298c3c5a38a11c51635761b2e2b5f28066f8979c94e5c12dd3ccd6d4241", "ja": "山を登っているような気持ちですか～。\n{$P$}さんって、面白いですね！", "zh": "爬山时的心情是吗～\n{$P$}先生，你好有趣哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "14f4906356c53f254a748a39e7c23c02bf69a3a0d0d7b2d585e10f78ce12b780", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました！\n山を登っているような気持ちで、頑張ります♪", "zh": "原来如此，我懂了！\n我会想像爬山时的心情，努力加油♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1011_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6889bbeeade2c80a2416ffbd5586ec217521357cab882a4810ad21d648441aae", "ja": "お疲れ、麗花。\n撮影は順調だな！", "zh": "辛苦了，丽花。\n拍摄相当顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ff61a26ab8bac424678847b4a818e2032c835c4dd7d681d806db142d17ae150", "ja": "はい、おかげさまで！\n最初は難しかったですけど、今はワクワクです♪", "zh": "是呀，托你的福！\n一开始虽然有点困难，不过现在觉得很期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "924ccd87e070a2ce65b28511d80a58d6b1d8de6c638fc459d36897dd99ef2651", "ja": "なんでも楽しめるのが麗花のいいところだな。\nここまでの写真を見てみるか？", "zh": "凡事都能乐在其中，就是丽花你的优点呢。\n要看看目前为止拍的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "1e53b91359c117c6f75767d3b65dbd41befab9fa540a3806757c70309be2aaed", "ja": "はい！\nちゃんと撮れてるかな～？", "zh": "好的！\n不知道拍得好不好～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "859c22ce65aa89676110d5c91a287fe12ed933893d0711e2135aa9c46e899442", "ja": "わあ……すごいすごい！　カワイイ♪\n私、まるで、アイドルみたいですね！", "zh": "哇……好棒哦！好棒哦！真可爱♪\n我简直就像是偶像一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8b1d764c469b27cd777ef539bf435793a1daa72e57d44b52998bb7d34fd687a4", "ja": "アイドルみたいというか、麗花はアイドルだよ。\nこれが初仕事だけどな。", "zh": "别说什么像是偶像，丽花，你就是偶像啊。\n虽然这是你的第一份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "a6cb37633efe5d3aa952b031b13c375c33ea2eb2a1d98eb33bdb22e5b263a976", "ja": "そうでした！　でも、うーん。\nまるで私じゃないみたいに見えます。すごいなー。", "zh": "我都忘了！不过，嗯──\n看起来完全不像我自己了呢。真厉害～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "639dd47d1029ff036acb3ab3d12ed2e94a796875b11aed72a9807602ae5c3e3f", "ja": "あ、でもでも……。", "zh": "啊，可是可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "18d162531d5f9652f5090e392594e21551e1fc20748023a27800d522426cc30b", "ja": "どうした？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "d2f5340607bebcde308f354237f3423ddfbc6d98ef224b8617acd28c1583faa7", "ja": "こうして{$P$}さんと\n一緒にいるのに、ひとりで映るのは寂しいです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生明明一直在旁边陪我，\n但照片只拍到我一个人，好寂寞哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "c37d182204f8d81065af8ec78564ec6850173212f376b63d5feb5174958efeb5", "ja": "だから、今度はふたりで写りましょう！\nうん、我ながらナイスアイディア♪", "zh": "所以呢，下一张我们两个一起拍吧！\n嗯，我真是冰雪聪明♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "702d538f0c79a86e078837f480dd98466cf3b969cd12768c838881f8d36335df", "ja": "い、いや。俺は写らなくていいんだよ。\nこれは麗花の宣材写真なんだから。", "zh": "等、等等，不用拍到我没关系啦。\n因为这是丽花的宣传照啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "8459ad3aba7bf387d96347df2dd1393a42d7ffad4d6c5b594acb22df5422c5cf", "ja": "そうですか？\nわかりました……じゃあこうしちゃいます♪", "zh": "是吗？\n好吧……不然这样好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "7577c6f806d7487b065e8bad23403e81f54b67d740eb2a6fe0ad040e1d49c704", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いきますよー！\nはい、カメラに向かって、やっほー♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我要拍啰～！\n来，看镜头，欢呼一下～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1026_se", "source_sha256": "fc2b0450a04029b53a4f50d1bf43b1dd4533a6262378234b43132650a081edd8", "ja": "パシャッ！", "zh": "喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1027_p", "source_sha256": "857f6b0f426c7bea68012a8863782882b1fe8c21f7cbd0bf1e63d2a95686465a", "ja": "俺の写真なんか撮って、どうするんだ？", "zh": "你拍我的照片要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "d533fec161c4afbb12c1e7c65f29ff0291d10a39feb71591c1b448fceafb733e", "ja": "ふふっ。あとで私の写真と合成するんです！", "zh": "呵呵，之后要拿来和我自己的照片合成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "ecd25e66f9e28556a5e5c79b3b8fab8e23cb71fbabba8d40197267a689855b88", "ja": "プロデューサーさんは、私のパートナーさんですし！\n今日は初めて宣材写真を撮った記念日ですから♪", "zh": "因为制作人先生是我的搭档啊！\n而且今天可是第一次拍摄宣传照的纪念日♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "14df278701024a75790786828c81a0dc9fe747e813891ff431d2ac85a0a8479e", "ja": "アイドルって初めての経験がいっぱいで楽しいです。\nこれからも、楽しいことをたくさんしましょうね♪", "zh": "当偶像会有很多新体验，真是开心。\n以后也要继续做很多开心的事情喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8ae92e2766df258d37ec62e2348c5834d8d5071f80671078d6d3134ef8d4f1f4", "ja": "なるほど……ありがとう、麗花。\nこれからもよろしくな！", "zh": "原来如此……谢谢你，丽花。\n以后也请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_002_1032_p", "source_sha256": "730de76c8d1a58e68c30b5385eb9569fff667cd7170237a4fce6d057aaa24618", "ja": "（楽しいことをたくさん、か……。麗花のことだ、\nきっとファンのことも楽しませてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（要做很多开心的事情，是吧……凭丽花的本事，\n一定能让粉丝也非常开心吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
